  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TinyValidations 1.0.0 is the first stable release of the core compile-time validation package. This release is focused on confidence: source-generator diagnostics fail invalid declarations before generation, generated source is covered by compile-backed tests, every built-in rule has runtime and generator coverage, comparable rules use IComparable<T> with default ordering, nested member paths are null-safe, regex patterns are validated during generation, duplicate custom rule declarations are deduplicated, and multi-assembly validation contributions are covered by tests and samples.",
